1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 24=

8
00:00:50,399 --> 00:00:52,460
Dong. Dong.

9
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:55,780
Please pick a nameplate
to decide on tonight's dinner.

10
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:58,060
Wan'er,

11
00:00:58,399 --> 00:01:00,359
I'm not some palace emperor.

12
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,640
Why would I flip nameplates
to pick a consort?

13
00:01:03,219 --> 00:01:04,219
Besides,

14
00:01:04,739 --> 00:01:06,400
only children make choices.

15
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:09,599
I want you all.

16
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:14,159
Why do you always have
such improper thoughts?

17
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:16,599
Who said anything about that?

18
00:01:16,799 --> 00:01:18,599
I'm asking you to choose

19
00:01:18,599 --> 00:01:21,079
what kind of food you want tonight.

20
00:01:21,219 --> 00:01:22,219
Is that so?

21
00:01:22,739 --> 00:01:25,859
Then why do all three nameplates
have your name on them?

22
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:28,239
Wan'er,

23
00:01:28,379 --> 00:01:29,920
do you wish for me to conquer

24
00:01:30,519 --> 00:01:31,799
the White Bone Demon thrice?

25
00:01:32,859 --> 00:01:34,659
Dong, you're annoying!

26
00:01:34,659 --> 00:01:35,659
You peeked!

27
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,359
You're so annoying.

28
00:01:38,239 --> 00:01:40,040
It's only because

29
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:43,239
you've been spending
day and night with Hanyan lately.

30
00:01:43,819 --> 00:01:45,959
What's wrong with me
wanting a few more turns?

31
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,459
Hanyan's father sent word
calling her back.

32
00:01:48,620 --> 00:01:50,159
I had to shower her with extra love.

33
00:01:56,459 --> 00:01:58,739
Hanyan's father certainly knows
how to have fun,

34
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:00,500
taking another pretty wife.

35
00:02:01,900 --> 00:02:03,040
You can even see that?

36
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:15,080
Yan, this is my new wife.

37
00:02:15,659 --> 00:02:16,659
Greet your mother.

38
00:02:18,020 --> 00:02:19,379
Greetings, Mother.

39
00:02:19,439 --> 00:02:20,439
Good.

40
00:02:20,699 --> 00:02:21,979
You returned in such haste.

41
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:23,900
I haven't prepared a gift for you.

42
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,560
You won't blame me, will you?

43
00:02:26,139 --> 00:02:27,139
Of course not.

44
00:02:27,139 --> 00:02:28,139
Yan,

45
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:31,120
I'm so relieved
to see you return safely.

46
00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:36,000
I wronged you
regarding what happened before.

47
00:02:36,740 --> 00:02:38,159
I'm glad you're well, Father.

48
00:02:40,659 --> 00:02:41,659
Father,

49
00:02:41,879 --> 00:02:44,300
I've found someone
to spend my life with.

50
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:45,900
My husband...

51
00:02:46,539 --> 00:02:49,139
Let bygones be bygones.

52
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:51,819
Your father's career is soaring now,

53
00:02:52,060 --> 00:02:53,479
and Her Majesty favors him greatly.

54
00:02:53,479 --> 00:02:54,479
His future is boundless.

55
00:02:54,759 --> 00:02:57,159
And your suffering has finally
come to an end, Yan.

56
00:02:57,539 --> 00:03:00,360
We have chosen a fine husband for you.

57
00:03:00,979 --> 00:03:02,300
It's the perfect match.

58
00:03:02,300 --> 00:03:03,300
What?

59
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:06,139
Mother, I already have a husband.

60
00:03:06,819 --> 00:03:07,819
Yan,

61
00:03:07,819 --> 00:03:08,879
parents' command

62
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:11,560
and a matchmaker's word
make a proper marriage.

63
00:03:11,979 --> 00:03:13,860
Entering into a betrothal on your own

64
00:03:14,180 --> 00:03:16,120
without proper rites
or a matchmaker is invalid.

65
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:19,319
Yan,

66
00:03:19,319 --> 00:03:23,280
I have arranged your marriage
with the heir of Marquis Yongchang.

67
00:03:23,439 --> 00:03:26,060
This brings immense honor to our family.

68
00:03:26,159 --> 00:03:29,419
Father, Zhao Dong and I
truly love each other.

69
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:30,879
We were lawfully wed,

70
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:32,080
with a written record.

71
00:03:32,659 --> 00:03:34,360
He saved me from danger time and again,

72
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:36,000
and he is the one I lean on.

73
00:03:37,319 --> 00:03:38,460
I will marry no one else.

74
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,939
Lawfully wed?

75
00:03:43,599 --> 00:03:44,599
I see no betrothal gifts

76
00:03:44,819 --> 00:03:46,159
or the full wedding rites.

77
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:49,240
He's nothing but a rustic fraud

78
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,360
who tricked you.

79
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,539
Your father looked into it.

80
00:03:53,159 --> 00:03:55,199
Zhao Dong is just a broke, lowly man.

81
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:59,060
How could he possibly be worthy of
an official's daughter like you?

82
00:03:59,060 --> 00:04:00,919
- Exactly.
- Listen to your father.

83
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,560
Just marry the marquis's heir.

84
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,639
You call him broke

85
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,219
and lowly?

86
00:04:08,860 --> 00:04:09,860
But Father,

87
00:04:10,740 --> 00:04:12,080
you were exonerated

88
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,659
and rose through the ranks.

89
00:04:14,039 --> 00:04:16,519
Do you know how any of that happened?

90
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:20,560
That was thanks to Her Majesty's wisdom.

91
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:21,920
You didn't mean

92
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:24,160
it was all because of Zhao Dong?

93
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,699
That's utterly ridiculous.

94
00:04:28,300 --> 00:04:29,980
Whether you believe it or not,

95
00:04:30,500 --> 00:04:32,360
it was all thanks
to my husband, Zhao Dong.

96
00:04:34,139 --> 00:04:36,500
I will have only Zhao Dong
as my husband in this life

97
00:04:36,500 --> 00:04:37,800
and never remarry.

98
00:04:39,379 --> 00:04:40,720
If you force me any further,

99
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:42,500
I will...

100
00:04:45,379 --> 00:04:46,379
I will die right here

101
00:04:46,379 --> 00:04:47,620
to protect my honor!

102
00:04:47,620 --> 00:04:49,000
How outrageous!

103
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,540
What an unfilial daughter!

104
00:04:52,019 --> 00:04:53,019
Yan,

105
00:04:55,860 --> 00:04:57,660
I'm not trying
to make things hard for you.

106
00:04:58,420 --> 00:05:02,399
Look, this marriage was decreed
by Her Majesty herself.

107
00:05:03,939 --> 00:05:04,959
If you disobey,

108
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:09,180
our entire clan will be executed.

109
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:12,620
Can you really bear to watch our family

110
00:05:12,959 --> 00:05:16,339
be dragged to the grave
for your selfishness?

111
00:05:21,063 --> 00:05:23,404
(Imperial Edict)

112
00:05:23,404 --> 00:05:25,053
(Liu Hanyan is hereby betrothed
to the heir of Marquis Yongchang)

113
00:05:28,819 --> 00:05:31,300
This really is Her Majesty's decree?

114
00:05:32,620 --> 00:05:33,620
But

115
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:36,720
she knows of my relationship
with Zhao Dong.

116
00:05:37,759 --> 00:05:40,180
Why would she issue such an edict?

117
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,480
Yan,

118
00:05:41,879 --> 00:05:43,240
do not speak ill of Her Majesty.

119
00:05:44,500 --> 00:05:47,480
Someone, escort the young lady
back to her room.

120
00:05:50,759 --> 00:05:51,759
Dong.

121
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:57,040
Dinner is almost ready.

122
00:05:58,639 --> 00:05:59,639
Keep the porridge warm.

123
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,800
I'll be right back.

124
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:12,060
So you're Zhao Dong?

125
00:06:14,959 --> 00:06:16,040
My daughter Yan

126
00:06:16,459 --> 00:06:17,819
was young and foolish,

127
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,480
beguiled by you.

128
00:06:19,839 --> 00:06:22,399
Whatever happened before
counts for nothing.

129
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:26,319
Take this banknote of 200 taels,

130
00:06:26,699 --> 00:06:27,800
write a letter of divorce,

131
00:06:28,220 --> 00:06:32,500
and sever all ties
with our daughter from now on.

132
00:06:32,899 --> 00:06:34,899
A country bumpkin like you

133
00:06:35,180 --> 00:06:37,399
dares to climb up to our Liu family?

134
00:06:37,860 --> 00:06:39,519
How delusional.

135
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:41,720
If you know better, take the money

136
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:42,720
and leave.

137
00:06:49,199 --> 00:06:50,199
Father-in-law,

138
00:06:50,620 --> 00:06:51,620
Mother-in-law,

139
00:06:52,319 --> 00:06:54,160
I, Zhao Dong, have come today
to propose to

140
00:06:55,259 --> 00:06:56,279
and marry Hanyan.

141
00:07:02,540 --> 00:07:03,540
My betrothal gifts.

142
00:07:04,379 --> 00:07:05,839
One is a Supreme Longevity Pill,

143
00:07:06,459 --> 00:07:07,720
which extends life by 60 years.

144
00:07:10,100 --> 00:07:11,819
The other is a Supreme Beauty Pill,

145
00:07:12,759 --> 00:07:14,139
which grants eternal youth

146
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:15,720
and restores one's beauty.

147
00:07:19,019 --> 00:07:20,019
What?

148
00:07:20,019 --> 00:07:21,379
Restores beauty?

149
00:07:21,379 --> 00:07:23,000
Extends life by 60 years?

150
00:07:23,139 --> 00:07:24,439
And grants eternal youth?

151
00:07:24,879 --> 00:07:25,879
Zhao Dong,

152
00:07:26,019 --> 00:07:28,560
at least make your lies believable.

153
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:32,300
You dare use two dirt pellets
as betrothal gifts?

154
00:07:32,300 --> 00:07:34,120
He's definitely a swindler.

155
00:07:34,220 --> 00:07:35,220
I think so too.

156
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:43,240
One try will tell you
whether it's real or not.

157
00:07:45,459 --> 00:07:48,100
Elderly lady, would you like to taste

158
00:07:48,439 --> 00:07:49,439
this Beauty Pill?

159
00:07:49,759 --> 00:07:51,759
She will. Right now.

160
00:07:51,759 --> 00:07:53,620
I'm going to expose you right here.

161
00:08:15,639 --> 00:08:16,639
What...

162
00:08:16,639 --> 00:08:18,680
It's real, Master! It's real!

163
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:21,060
This pill is truly priceless!

164
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:23,319
I will pay 1,000 taels...

165
00:08:23,519 --> 00:08:26,620
no, 10,000 taels of gold
to buy this pill.

166
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:33,600
However, regarding Yan's marriage,
I must decline.

167
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:36,759
The marriage was decreed by Her Majesty.

168
00:08:37,379 --> 00:08:38,639
We simply couldn't defy it.

169
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,320
An imperial edict?

170
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:42,480
Indeed.

171
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:46,059
Defying the imperial edict
is punishable by death.

172
00:08:46,919 --> 00:08:49,259
I am powerless to help.

173
00:08:50,820 --> 00:08:52,080
Chu Yunxi.

174
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:55,179
Fine. Very well.

175
00:08:55,940 --> 00:08:59,179
Looks like someone is itching
for a spanking again

176
00:08:59,740 --> 00:09:00,799
and needs a lesson.

177
00:09:03,559 --> 00:09:04,559
As for these pills,

178
00:09:05,220 --> 00:09:06,220
you don't deserve them.

179
00:09:07,039 --> 00:09:08,039
And as for Hanyan,

180
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:10,379
I'm taking her with me today.

181
00:09:10,460 --> 00:09:12,460
W-What do you mean?

182
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:15,240
Liu Hanyan is my lawfully wedded wife,

183
00:09:15,879 --> 00:09:16,879
witnessed by heaven, earth,

184
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,360
the sun, and the moon.

185
00:09:19,340 --> 00:09:20,460
Let alone an imperial edict,

186
00:09:21,139 --> 00:09:25,000
not even the heavens themselves
can take her away from me.

187
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:28,879
Where is he?

188
00:09:28,879 --> 00:09:31,320
Master, he took the pills too.

189
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,419
The pills are gone.

190
00:09:32,779 --> 00:09:34,559
H-How could a person just...

191
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:37,419
Master, bad news.
The young lady vanished into thin air!

192
00:09:37,559 --> 00:09:38,559
- What?
- What?

193
00:09:42,820 --> 00:09:45,259
You're here, Dong.

194
00:10:01,519 --> 00:10:02,759
You are quiet.

195
00:10:03,179 --> 00:10:07,059
Are you displeased with my decree
regarding Liu Hanyan's marriage?

196
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,799
But you must know

197
00:10:10,759 --> 00:10:12,159
I am the Empress.

198
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,740
The Empress's man

199
00:10:15,139 --> 00:10:17,919
cannot harbor other women in his heart.

200
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,080
Yunxi,

201
00:10:21,559 --> 00:10:24,399
your heart is vast enough
to hold the whole empire.

202
00:10:25,279 --> 00:10:26,840
Can it not hold a few sisters?

203
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,440
This isn't like you.

204
00:10:30,279 --> 00:10:31,279
Then

205
00:10:31,940 --> 00:10:33,720
between me and other women,

206
00:10:34,299 --> 00:10:35,740
you can only choose one.

207
00:10:38,620 --> 00:10:40,360
I won't give up on anyone.

208
00:10:41,659 --> 00:10:45,399
Except you, you wretch.

209
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:51,580
How boring. You saw through me.

210
00:10:53,679 --> 00:10:55,820
If I apologize now,

211
00:10:56,500 --> 00:10:57,960
will you forgive me?

212
00:10:59,899 --> 00:11:01,159
Our bond is severed.

213
00:11:01,539 --> 00:11:03,259
Let the past stay in the past.

214
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,080
No.

215
00:11:06,779 --> 00:11:08,179
I know you still resent me.

216
00:11:08,879 --> 00:11:11,419
Why don't you hit me a few times

217
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:12,960
to vent your anger?

218
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:15,320
Get out of Yunxi's body.

219
00:11:23,019 --> 00:11:24,019
Dong.

220
00:11:24,879 --> 00:11:26,960
I'm here. Don't be afraid.

221
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:32,019
Immortal Venerable,
are you truly this heartless?

222
00:11:33,460 --> 00:11:34,639
If I were heartless,

223
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,320
you'd have been reduced to dust.

224
00:11:36,419 --> 00:11:38,620
I am now the Divine Venerable
of Supreme Eternity,

225
00:11:39,399 --> 00:11:41,279
yet I feel utterly lonely inside.

226
00:11:41,799 --> 00:11:43,940
I often reminisce about
how loving we once were.

227
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,879
I am willing to be your woman

228
00:11:46,100 --> 00:11:48,620
and never betray you again, alright?

229
00:11:49,019 --> 00:11:50,019
You don't deserve to.

230
00:12:08,043 --> 00:12:09,917
(Sixteen years later)

231
00:12:23,668 --> 00:12:27,981
♪Destiny shifts. In the mortal realm♪

232
00:12:29,279 --> 00:12:33,127
♪A new romantic bond rises,
unlocking the heart♪

233
00:12:34,730 --> 00:12:38,417
♪Former powers vanish
like mist and smoke♪

234
00:12:38,417 --> 00:12:40,820
(Liu Residence)

235
00:12:40,820 --> 00:12:43,860
Brother Zhao, is my attire appropriate?

236
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:46,379
I heard Nianqing dislikes extravagance.

237
00:12:46,639 --> 00:12:48,059
I didn't dare wear my official robes.

238
00:12:49,279 --> 00:12:50,279
Minister Liang,

239
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,940
you're a first-rank official

240
00:12:52,279 --> 00:12:53,940
overseeing the Ministry of Revenue now.

241
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:56,259
You speak with such confidence in court.

242
00:12:56,740 --> 00:12:57,740
Why,

243
00:12:58,139 --> 00:12:59,559
at the Liu Residence's doorstep,

244
00:13:00,500 --> 00:13:03,360
are you acting like a boy
proposing for the first time?

245
00:13:04,279 --> 00:13:06,620
Your Majesty, please don't tease me.

246
00:13:07,539 --> 00:13:08,659
For the past 16 years,

247
00:13:09,340 --> 00:13:11,700
I have never forgotten my promise

248
00:13:12,879 --> 00:13:13,940
or taken a wife.

249
00:13:15,139 --> 00:13:16,139
I only fear...

250
00:13:17,042 --> 00:13:20,899
I only fear she'll be disappointed
to see how old I look.

251
00:13:23,259 --> 00:13:24,480
Meng Po's soup was thinned.

252
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:26,379
She remembers your name

253
00:13:26,980 --> 00:13:28,259
and the 16-year promise.

254
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:30,539
She just doesn't recall your face.

255
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:32,840
Rest assured.
A true heart is like a mirror.

256
00:13:33,139 --> 00:13:34,200
Even dusted, it reflects.

257
00:13:35,179 --> 00:13:37,139
Your unwavering devotion of 16 years

258
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:38,779
is the best betrothal gift.

259
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:41,120
It will surely awaken
her dormant memories.

260
00:13:41,644 --> 00:13:46,638
♪Only the starlight in my heart remains♪

261
00:13:48,581 --> 00:13:52,971
♪Searching for the one who made it beat♪

262
00:13:53,390 --> 00:13:57,980
♪Dancing through
the mortal realm hand in hand♪

263
00:13:57,980 --> 00:14:00,460
Liang Shanbo of An County
has come to fulfill his promise

264
00:14:01,820 --> 00:14:03,740
and propose marriage to Miss Liu.

265
00:14:05,290 --> 00:14:09,824
♪Power grows truer
when mingled with love♪

266
00:14:10,426 --> 00:14:15,684
♪Together we play the symphony of fate♪

267
00:14:15,908 --> 00:14:21,776
♪Finding heaven's radiance
in the mortal realm♪

268
00:14:23,625 --> 00:14:29,118
♪Every embrace is a covenant of souls♪

269
00:14:29,118 --> 00:14:34,978
♪Every gaze weaves our future together♪

270
00:14:35,616 --> 00:14:41,131
♪Transcending mortal bounds,
two hearts beat as one♪

271
00:14:41,131 --> 00:14:48,623
♪Love is the greatest spell,
breaking every barrier♪

272
00:14:49,879 --> 00:14:53,360
Liang Shanbo of An County
has come to fulfill his promise.

273
00:14:54,640 --> 00:14:59,419
♪Power grows truer
when mingled with love♪

274
00:14:59,419 --> 00:15:01,120
You're finally here.

275
00:15:05,219 --> 00:15:11,322
♪Finding heaven's radiance
in the mortal realm♪

276
00:15:13,974 --> 00:15:19,178
♪Though cultivation dreams fade,
love never dies♪

277
00:15:19,178 --> 00:15:28,579
♪Leaving an immortal vow
in this mortal world♪

278
00:15:47,184 --> 00:15:50,775
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

279
00:15:50,775 --> 00:15:53,562
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

280
00:15:54,138 --> 00:15:56,300
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

281
00:15:56,300 --> 00:15:59,146
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

282
00:15:59,146 --> 00:16:02,424
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

283
00:16:02,424 --> 00:16:04,058
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

284
00:16:04,058 --> 00:16:06,122
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

285
00:16:06,122 --> 00:16:07,658
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

286
00:16:07,658 --> 00:16:10,440
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

287
00:16:10,889 --> 00:16:12,794
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

288
00:16:12,794 --> 00:16:18,825
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

289
00:16:19,407 --> 00:16:23,290
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

290
00:16:23,290 --> 00:16:26,515
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

291
00:16:27,027 --> 00:16:29,626
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

292
00:16:29,626 --> 00:16:34,754
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

293
00:16:34,754 --> 00:16:38,282
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

294
00:16:38,282 --> 00:16:41,990
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

295
00:16:41,990 --> 00:16:43,882
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

296
00:16:43,882 --> 00:16:45,959
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

297
00:16:45,959 --> 00:16:48,490
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

298
00:16:48,490 --> 00:16:52,527
♪You met the most precious person♪

299
00:16:54,195 --> 00:16:56,058
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

300
00:16:56,058 --> 00:16:58,577
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

301
00:16:58,577 --> 00:17:00,026
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

302
00:17:00,026 --> 00:17:02,328
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

303
00:17:02,328 --> 00:17:04,298
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

304
00:17:04,298 --> 00:17:08,708
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

305
00:17:08,708 --> 00:17:10,250
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

306
00:17:10,250 --> 00:17:12,160
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

307
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:15,434
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

308
00:17:15,434 --> 00:17:18,755
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

309
00:17:18,755 --> 00:17:20,490
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

310
00:17:20,490 --> 00:17:25,114
♪Just catch your breath first♪

311
00:17:25,114 --> 00:17:28,864
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

312
00:17:28,864 --> 00:17:32,242
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

313
00:17:32,616 --> 00:17:34,586
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

314
00:17:34,586 --> 00:17:40,333
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

315
00:17:40,333 --> 00:17:43,849
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

316
00:17:43,849 --> 00:17:45,418
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

317
00:17:45,418 --> 00:17:47,728
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

318
00:17:47,728 --> 00:17:49,466
♪From laughter to devotion♪

319
00:17:49,466 --> 00:17:51,522
♪From falling to innocence♪

320
00:17:51,522 --> 00:17:53,370
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

321
00:17:53,370 --> 00:18:00,040
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
